    "type": "mc",
    "text": "Implicit differentiation also proves the power rule for fractional powers. What is $frac{d}{dx} x^(2/3)$?",
    "options": [
     "$frac{2}{3}x^(-1/3)$",
     "$frac{2}{3}x^(1/3)$",
     "$frac{3}{2}x^(1/2)$",
     "$x^(-1/3)$"
    ],
    "answer": 0,
    "hint": "Same power rule: bring down $frac{2}{3}$ and subtract 1.",
    "explain": "$frac{2}{3} - 1 = -frac{1}{3}$"
   }
  ]
 }
